local v25 = {
    {
        ["Type"] = "TextTemplate",
        ["Content"] = "<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">GLOBAL</font>\n\226\128\162 Sentinel Stacking no longer reduces stun durations.\n\226\128\162 Sentinel Stacking now significantly increases the duration of stun immunity after a stun ends for each Sentinel alive in the match.\n  \226\128\162 Each additional Sentinel alive adds +3s of stun immunity.\n\226\128\162 The old Weakness effect has been renamed to Vulnerable.\n\226\128\162 Weakness is now used for a new status effect that reduces damage output by 10% per level.\n\226\128\162 Added a new status effect: Exhausted.\n  \226\128\162 Exhausted reduces stamina regeneration and increases stamina drain by 10% per level.\n  \226\128\162 The stamina bar turns red while Exhausted is active.\n\226\128\162 Stun immunity\226\128\153s visual indicator has been updated.\n\226\128\162 Invisibility now hides all active particle effects.\n\226\128\162 Terror Radiuses have been globally increased by 1.25x.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Shedletsky</font>\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Slash</font>\n\226\128\162 Windup decreased from 0.575s to 0.525s.\n\226\128\162 Resistance on cast duration reduced from 0.575s to 0.525s.\n\226\128\162 Self-slow duration reduced from 1.575s to 1.4s.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Fried Chicken</font>\n\226\128\162 Healing over time reduced from 35 to 25.\n  \226\128\162 Now heals 30 total.\n\226\128\162 Healing is now canceled when taking 5 or more damage.\n  \226\128\162 ( Previously canceled when taking 10 or more damage. )\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Taph</font>\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Subscape Tripmine</font>\n\226\128\162 Killer detection detonation no longer triggers through walls.\n  \226\128\162 Tripmine can still hit through walls, but it will no longer detonate if it detects a Killer through a wall.\n\226\128\162 Detonation time increased from 0.4s to 0.5s.\n\226\128\162 Killer detection and explosion radius increased from 16 to 19 studs.\n\226\128\162 Stacking status reduction penalty increased from 0.85s to 2s.\n\226\128\162 Subspaced duration increased from 5s to 6s.\n\226\128\162 Now also applies Weakness V for 6s.\n\226\128\162 Helpless duration reduced from 5s to 3s.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Tripwire</font>\n\226\128\162 Now has a 1.5s arming time after being placed.\n\226\128\162 Stacking status reduction penalty increased from 0.85s to 1.5s.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(200,150,20)\">Slasher</font>\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Behead</font>\n\226\128\162 Damage increased from 20 to 25.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Gashing Wound</font>\n\226\128\162 Follow-up hits now have their hitbox size reverted to match the initial hit.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(50,225,50)\">1x1x1x1</font>\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Entanglement</font>\n\226\128\162 Pull strength reduced by 50%.\n\226\128\162 Glitched pull strength bonus increased from 50% to 75%.\n\226\128\162 Glitched and Helpless duration reduced from 6s to 5s.\n\226\128\162 Stun duration now scales based on distance traveled.\n  \226\128\162 Starts at 0.85s.\n  \226\128\162 Scales up to 1.25s over 75 studs.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Mass Infection</font>\n\226\128\162 Speed boost removed.\n\226\128\162 Projectile speed increased by 4%.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Unstable Eye</font>\n\226\128\162 Speed boost duration increased from 1.25s to 1.5s.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Rejuvinate the Rotten</font>\n\226\128\162 Minion lock-on range decreased from 24 studs to 20 studs.\n\226\128\162 Minion drop aggro range decreased from 40 studs to 30 studs.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Guest 1337</font>\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">General</font>\n\226\128\162 Knockback stacking nerf increased from 8% to 10%.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Block</font>\n\226\128\162 Increased ability lockout after a failed block.\n  \226\128\162 Guest 1337 can no longer use abilities until 2s after failing a block.\n\226\128\162 Fixed on-hit Killer slowness being much stronger than intended.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Charge</font>\n\226\128\162 Knockback now ramps up based on how long Charge is held.\n  \226\128\162 Starts at 6 knockback.\n  \226\128\162 Scales up to 11 knockback after 0.5s.\n  \226\128\162 Previously had a flat 9 knockback.\n\226\128\162 On-hit resistance duration decreased from 1.25s to 0.75s.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Punch</font>\n\226\128\162 Cooldown decreased from 60s to 55s.\n\226\128\162 Status effect durations are now reduced by 0.35s for every additional Guest 1337 alive.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Noob</font>\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Slateskin Potion</font>\n\226\128\162 Slateskin now grants +1 hitbox priority while active.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">007n7</font>\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Inject</font>\n\226\128\162 Cursor mode now decreases Clone\226\128\153s duration by 50% when used.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(101,28,50)\">Nosferatu</font>\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Hunter\'s Feast</font>\n\226\128\162 Windup reverted to 0.23s.\n\226\128\162 Endlag reduced from 0.5s to 0.4s.\n\226\128\162 Redirect projectile speed bonus increased from 3x to 4x.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Cataclysm</font>\n\226\128\162 Slowness duration increased from 6.0s to 7.5s\n\226\128\162 Reveal duration increased from 6.0s to 7.5s\n\226\128\162 Bleeding duration increased from 5.0s to 7.5s\n\226\128\162 Bleeding level decreased from 3 -> 2\n\n<font color=\"rgb(200,20,20)\">c00lkidd</font>\n\226\128\162 Mobile aiming has been reverted back to cursor-based aiming\n\n<font color=\"rgb(200,0,0)\">Guest 666</font>\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Base Stats</font>\n\226\128\162 Blood Orbs now travel 100% faster toward Guest 666.\n\226\128\162 Blood Orb lifetime increased from 60s to 90s.\n\226\128\162 Blood Orbs no longer reduce Slash\226\128\153s cooldown when collected.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Eviscerate</font>\n\226\128\162 Slowness duration increased from 2s to 2.5s.\n\226\128\162 Slowness now always applies, regardless of whether Eviscerate hits or misses.\n  \226\128\162 Hitting Eviscerate now cuts the Slowness duration by 50%.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Demonic Pursuit</font>\n\226\128\162 Minimum charge duration increased from 0.5s to 0.6s.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Infernal Cry</font>\n\226\128\162 Blood Hunt Speed duration reduced from 3s to 2s.\n\226\128\162 Blood Hunt Strength duration reduced from 8s to 6s.\n\226\128\162 Highlight duration reduced from 12s to 11s.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Blood Rush</font>\n\226\128\162 Maximum highlight duration decreased from 20s to 15s.\n\226\128\162 Reduced the maximum range for the highlight from 200 studs to 150 studs.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Blood Hunt</font>\n\226\128\162 No longer self-inflicts Slowness and Helpless when stunned.\n\226\128\162 Base speed boost increased from 4% to 6%.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Builderman</font>\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Sentry Construction</font>\n\226\128\162 Cooldown decreased from 45s to 35s.\n\226\128\162 Cooldown now only begins once the Sentry is destroyed by a Killer.\n  \226\128\162 Ability can now be used at any time, but becomes locked if the Sentry has shot at something within the last 10s.\n\226\128\162 Sentry Slowness level is now reduced from II to I if there is more than one Builderman alive.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Dispenser Construction</font>\n\226\128\162 Cooldown decreased from 45s to 30s.\n\226\128\162 Cooldown now only begins once the Dispenser is destroyed by a Killer.\n  \226\128\162 Ability can now be used at any time, but becomes locked if the Dispenser has healed a player within the last 10s.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Carry</font>\nBuilderman now has a new ability: Carry.\n\226\128\162 Carry allows Builderman to pick up his buildings and move them around.\n\226\128\162 Builderman moves slower while carrying a building.\n  \226\128\162 The carried building becomes inactive while being moved.\n\226\128\162 Placing a building down with Carry makes it build up much faster than normal.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Jane Doe</font>\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Shatterpoint</font>\n\226\128\162 Shatterpoint HP gain stacking nerf increased from 8% to 10%.\n\226\128\162 Starting Shatterpoint HP gain is now reduced by 10% for every additional Jane Doe alive in the match.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Crystal Pitch</font>\n\226\128\162 Failing to apply Resonance on a Killer will now also prevent Jane Doe from gaining any Shatterpoint HP from that hit.\n\226\128\162 Resonance will no longer fail to apply on stun-immune Killers.\n  \226\128\162 Fully stunned Killers are still immune to new Resonance applications.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Hatchet</font>\n\226\128\162 Stun stacking nerf increased from 0.125 per level to 0.15 per level.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Elliot</font>\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Pizza Throw</font>\n\226\128\162 Cooldown reduced from 45s to 30s.\n\226\128\162 Base healing reduced from 5 instant + 20 over time to 5 instant + 15 over time.\n\226\128\162 Order Up passive scaling reduced from +4 healing per generator to +2 healing per generator.\n\226\128\162 Time to heal reduced from 5s to 4s.\n\226\128\162 Healing is now canceled when taking 5 or more damage.\n  \226\128\162 Previously canceled when taking 10 or more damage.\n\226\128\162 Fixed stacking nerfs not working properly.\n\226\128\162 Pizza now emits green plus (+) particles to make it clearer that it heals.\n\226\128\162 Pizza now has a timer above it to indicate its remaining lifetime.\n\226\128\162 007n7 clones can no longer eat pizza.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Rush Hour</font>\n\226\128\162 Cooldown reduced from 40s to 30s.\n\226\128\162 Speed duration increased from 3s to 4s.\n\226\128\162 Speed level now matches the amount of charges stored.\n\226\128\162 Max charges increased from 1 to 3.\n\226\128\162 Using Rush Hour consumes all charges.\n\226\128\162 Now inflicts Exhausted II for 4s after Rush Hour ends.\n  \226\128\162 Exhausted is only applied if the Killer is within 85 studs of Elliot and has a more than Speed 1 when Rush Hour is used.\n\226\128\162 Rush Hour no longer consumes charges if used more than 85 studs away from the Killer.\n  \226\128\162 The ability icon will change colors to indicate this.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">TwoTime</font>\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Sacrificial Dagger</font>\n\226\128\162 Windup reduced from 0.3s to 0.25s.\n\226\128\162 Stun duration reduced from 3.5s to 2s.\n\226\128\162 Oblation gain on frontstab reduced from 37% to 20%.\n\226\128\162 Oblation gain on backstab reduced from 57% to 40%.\n\226\128\162 Landing Sacrificial Dagger no longer grants direct healing.\n\226\128\162 Regular Stab no longer has the small forward lunge.\n  \226\128\162 Hitbox and hitbox offset adjusted to compensate.\n\226\128\162 Backstab detection no longer uses the extrapolated position of TwoTime and the Killer.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Crouch</font>\n\226\128\162 Crouchstab now increases Backstab\226\128\153s stun duration from 2s to 3.5s.\n\226\128\162 Crouchstabs now give 25% more Oblation.\n\226\128\162 TwoTime gradually gains speed while running toward the Killer while crouched.\n  \226\128\162 Speed boost scales up to 35% over 5s.\n  \226\128\162 This boost is instantly lost if TwoTime takes damage, exits crouch, or stops running toward the Killer.\n\226\128\162 Dagger visual is now properly affected by the Invisibility status effect.\n\226\128\162 Crouch startup SFX range reduced.\n\226\128\162 Crouchstab windup SFX made quieter.\n\226\128\162 Cooldown reduced from 45s to 35s.\n\226\128\162 Crouch running speed increased from 20 to 23.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Pray</font>\nAdded a new ability: Pray.\n\226\128\162 Can be used near TwoTime\226\128\153s Ritual to rapidly exchange Oblation for Health.\n  \226\128\162 Converts at a 2:1 Oblation% to Health ratio.\n  \226\128\162 Plays a praying animation and locks movement while active.\n  \226\128\162 The button must be held down to continue exchanging.\n  \226\128\162 The animation and exchange end when the button is released or when TwoTime reaches maximum health.\n\226\128\162 Attempting to use Pray while away from your Ritual will highlight your Ritual for 4s and tell you to go find it.\n\226\128\162 Pray has no cooldown.\n\n<font color=\"rgb(255,255,255)\">Second Life Form</font>\n* Maximum health increased from 40 to 50.\n* Timer is now split into 15s / 25s.\n  * Previously 20s / 20s.\n\t\t\t\t\t"
